   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it adds nothing to the analysis?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 10","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 4","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 7","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 5","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 10$q$, $q$Quispe's childhood hobby says nothing about whether the amber lights helped moths. Sentence 7 is the draft's strongest evidence, so removing it would weaken the argument.$q$, 'draft', '197bf5f5-144d-51d3-8119-51f176531634')
