   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it does not support the claim in sentence 2?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 4","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 11","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 9","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 5","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 11$q$, $q$Ferrante's music teaching has no bearing on whether her records are useful scientific evidence. Sentence 9 explains where the weaker readings came from, which sets up the testing described in sentence 10.$q$, 'draft', 'e30d68c0-c979-5c17-a80e-dae56e7cea1f')
